# An sqlplus session through dbbat against Oracle 23ai Free whose select
# list carries LOBs (see ociLOBQuery): every server payload that leads with
# a describe (TTC 0x10) or a ROW_HEADER (TTC 0x06), as the TNS Data payload
# with its two data-flag bytes first — exactly as extractTTCPayload gets it.
#
# The last two frames are the pair the fixture exists for: a describe that
# carries no row values at all, because Oracle turns row prefetch off when a
# LOB is in the select list, and the packet the whole fetch then arrives in.
#
# Regenerate with:
#   ORACLE_CAPTURE_OCI_FIXTURES=1 ORACLE_TEST_OCI_CLIENT=container \
#     go test -tags integration -run TestCapture_OCILOBFetchThroughDBBat ./internal/proxy/oracle/



